   (full hashes), `git rev-parse c8ae0054^{tree}`, `git merge-base --is-ancestor` to
   confirm `c8ae0054` is on the current line, `git log` for the chain
   (`a14345ce` → `28820ff5` → `c8ae0054`). Nothing copied from other reports.
2. **File identities at the revision.** `git show <rev>:<path> | sha256sum` for
   `SwiftExpr.hx` and the three gap-fixture files, at `c8ae0054` and at `a14345ce`.
3. **Measured at the frozen revision, not on the moving tree.** The live worktree
   carries uncommitted `SwiftExpr.hx` edits, so I exported a clean `c8ae0054` tree
