   fixing commit `d14231a6` whose own message admits the broken state.
5. **Sentinels respected.** `grep -c 'Test.equals' samples/boring/MathNaNTestSupport.hx`
   = 5 before and after; no test deleted, skipped, weakened, or edited; all
   generation/measurement ran in `/tmp` copies.

